        <activityName xml:lang="en">Facade substructure, integrated, Sto, Ventec Artline invisible, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Facade substructure, integrated, Sto, Ventec Artline invisible, at plant
na;
UUID: 624ffa71-f469-3f1c-afb4-4952258b1f2b
Included is the production of the individual parts used for the facade construction as well as the transport from the production sites to Switzerland.
Location: Data apply to the supply in Switzerland. Production occurs at SAPA Building Systems AG in Nenzing (AT) and Bellenberg (DE).
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data survey at SAPA Building Systems AG. 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_624ffa71-f469-3f1c-afb4-4952258b1f2b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
